{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monster-catching, <strong>dungeon-crawling</strong> RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a peaceful villager, <strong>Anza</strong> lost everything when the Archfiend Natas razed his home and slaughtered his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing left to lose, he descends into dangerous dungeons, capturing monsters and growing stronger to face the demon who took everything from him.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854280/extras/a4eb4026d8dbb44697e4e080abfec5b4.webp?t=1771003999\" width=616 height=60 /></span><strong> </strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Catching &amp; Team Building</strong> \u2013 Capture a variety of monsters and train them to create a powerful team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Randomly Generated Dungeons</strong> \u2013 Every dungeon is unique, filled with dangerous enemies and valuable treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Equipment</strong> \u2013 Find rare items or purchase better gear to enhance your team\u2019s abilities. </p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Steady Progression &amp; Increasing Difficulty</strong> \u2013 Level up your character and monsters, unlocking new areas and taking on powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854280/extras/2015db2c1f0f3e90fcf03883c74d8374.webp?t=1771003999\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by exploring dangerous dungeons, capturing monsters and leveling up both Anza and your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1854280/extras/b9af487212c7a2926b9ca7294a92da18.avif?t=1771003999\" width=500 height=160 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The overworld is semi-open, as you grow stronger, new regions become accessible, offering tougher challenges and greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anza can unlock new abilities by leveling up his Mana Orbs. Monster learn new abilities through level ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster has a random potential and nature.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Slave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1854280/f680ccf6931e6dc79a1a2bd7a379da36ad9e6af3.jpg"},{"name":"Master Tamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1854280/88d0023e85093f29379fd4651c0fd0c0161f5858.jpg"},{"name":"First Treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1854280/ebe70a290e56bcf4629bb6d1d6313a73028ae864.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1854280/71d95f1e0d98e56948237c99aec75addc88c693e.jpg"},{"name":"Helpful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1854280/e3200b109744a60f49e32bc55c9f127c34a6d511.jpg"},{"name":"Hero of the People","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1854280/b240f99ac95e7ac92257210dc3e9e0ffd76614e4.jpg"},{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams